WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,400
These camp coins are yours to repay, not me.

2
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:04,600
It's my helper

3
00:00:04,600 --> 00:00:07,100
He followed Uncle Xu's team and killed a smiling eye to report it.

4
00:00:07,100 --> 00:00:08,500
So that's it

5
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:13,100
Then if you have extra gold coins or resources that you want to sell, you can feel free to contact me.

6
00:00:13,100 --> 00:00:16,000
The price I offer will never be lower than the market price, huh?

7
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:18,000
If there is a deal, I will definitely come to you first

8
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:19,420
ok

9
00:00:19,420 --> 00:00:21,220
If you can't survive

10
00:00:21,220 --> 00:00:29,880
You can also choose to join my room

11
00:00:29,880 --> 00:00:32,340
It's just luck that he survived

12
00:00:32,340 --> 00:00:35,630
Even the second-level gate may not be able to withstand tomorrow's monsters.

13
00:00:35,630 --> 00:00:39,130
When the time comes, we will be able to successfully capture him.

14
00:00:39,130 --> 00:00:41,160
This world can't survive

15
00:00:41,160 --> 00:00:43,730
High risk equals high reward

16
00:00:43,730 --> 00:00:46,030
If we could recruit two assistants with combat talents,

17
00:00:46,030 --> 00:00:48,530
Go out for me to collect information and explore the abandoned city.

18
00:00:48,530 --> 00:00:50,030
I can sit firmly on the Diaoyutai
